# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the vendored civetweb server.
#
# Every report left after the test fixtures were made race-free has both
# accesses inside civetweb (stop_flag written by mg_stop without the lock that
# consume_socket holds while reading it, plus start/stop bookkeeping). Only
# civetweb function names are listed; races whose stacks touch sb-easy code
# only are not suppressed.
#
# Usage: TSAN_OPTIONS="suppressions=<repo>/c/tsan.supp" ctest ...
race:mg_stop
race:consume_socket
race:master_thread_run
race:push_inner
race:mg_get_server_ports
race:close_all_listening_sockets
race:mg_poll
